  <History Date="08-09-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="16-09-14" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated colour and gobo in response to manufacturer request." />
  <History Date="04-05-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated basic modes to use simplified shutter channel in attempt to fix bug report from distributor." />
  <History Date="14-09-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Prolights Moonstone" />
  <History Date="17-09-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  Fixed duplicate ID's in else conditions.  Recreated palettes." />
